<title>USA: Wavetech hires investment bankers.</title>
<headline>Wavetech hires investment bankers.</headline>
<dateline>TUCSON, Ariz. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wavetech Inc Thursday said it has hired investment banking firm Sterne, Agee &amp; Leach to advise it on capital market deals, possible strategic alliances and possible mergers and acquisitions.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said its agreement with the Atlanta-based investment bankers covers one year.</p>
<p>&quot;Their broad-based experience and knowledge of our industry makes them the ideal financial services firm to counsel us in our efforts to maximize the potential and returns of our business,&quot; said Gerald Quinn, chief executive officer. Wavetech is a diversified telecommunications company.</p>
</text>
